herdr-tui-layout, a layout for the Herdr app. Not affiliated with Herdr.

These mods are modified copies of mods shipped with the Herdr app,
used under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE); each main.js says
what changed:
  mods/herdr-tui-layout-help
  mods/herdr-tui-layout-menu
  mods/herdr-tui-layout-picker
  mods/herdr-tui-layout-prompt
  mods/herdr-tui-layout-worktree

mods/herdr-tui-layout-worktree also carries its base branch field and
startup script picker, ported from the herdrtw layout
(https://github.com/luqastw/herdrtw, mods/herdrtw/parts/worktree.js) —
itself a modified copy of the same Herdr mod, Apache-2.0.
